cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it."
type: software

title: "Extraction and Analysis of Beta Bursts from EEG Signals"

authors:
  - family-names: Banerjee
    given-names: Anandi

repository-code: "https://github.com/Aanandi10/Extraction-and-Analysis-of-Beta-Bursts-from-EEG-signals"

abstract: >
  MATLAB-based implementation for the extraction,
  detection and analysis of beta bursts from EEG signals,
  incorporating Hilbert transform-based amplitude envelope
  estimation, threshold-based burst detection,
  spectral analysis and time-frequency visualisation.

